// [Event Agency.note]                  search in ssTEA source files for a reference to this file.
//
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   The ssTEA Event Declarations note explains the compiler language terms used to implement ssTEA.
   The ssTEA Event Agency note explains Event activities as they are implemented usin the terms.
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   EvInfo data is the ssTEA knowledge about all events.  ssE_pAboutEv is the API Agency data (type
   and variable) describing one instance an event, as specified by the User of the Agency Api.
   There is one EvInfo for each Event actively managed by ssTEA, and privately kept by ssTEA.
   In each EvInfo is a pointer to the Event Description which is used by ssTEA to manage the Event.
   Event Descriptions pointed to are a copy of ssTEA's (App not trusted) or are ssTEA's (trusted).
   -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//

// S~S  SimpleSal signal ends  S~S

